        "title": "Use exterior angles",
        "body": "The exterior angles of any polygon sum to $360^\\circ$, so each exterior angle is $360^\\circ/180=2^\\circ$ and each interior angle is $180^\\circ-2^\\circ=178^\\circ$.\n\n**Answer: (E) $178^\\circ$**"
