    "answer": "A",
    "acceptedAnswers": null,
    "answerUnit": null,
    "solutions": [
      {
        "title": "Median then mean",
        "body": "Since $x>46$, the middle (fifth) number is $30$, so the median is $30$. The mean must be $30$, so the sum of all nine numbers is $270$. The eight known numbers sum to $223$, so $x=270-223=47$.\n\n**Answer: (A) 47**"
