        "title": "Count ways for each sum",
        "body": "For a sum $s$ with $2\\le s\\le21$ there are $s-1$ ways (first die any value from $1$ to $s-1$). For $s\\ge21$ the count decreases again: $s=21$ has $20$ ways (first die $1,\\dots,20$, second die $21-$first), the maximum. Sums $22,\\dots,40$ have $19,18,\\dots,1$ ways.\n\n**Answer: (D) 21**"
      }
