        "title": "Binomial count",
        "body": "The grid is $4$ squares wide and $2$ squares high, so every route has $4$ steps right and $2$ steps up. The number of orders is $\\binom{6}{2}=15$.\n\n**Answer: (D) 15**"
      },
      {
        "title": "Label the points",
        "body": "Label each point with the number of ways to reach it: bottom row and left column are all $1$; each other point is the sum of the point to its left and the point below. The middle row reads $1,2,3,4,5$ and the top row $1,3,6,10,15$, so $B$ gets $15$.\n\n**Answer: (D) 15**"
