    "answerUnit": null,
    "solutions": [
      {
        "title": "Inner block",
        "body": "Let the prism be $\\ell\\times b\\times h$ cubes with $\\ell bh=120$. The unpainted cubes form the inner block $(\\ell-2)(b-2)(h-2)=24$. Trying the factorisations of $120$, only $4\\times5\\times6$ works: $2\\cdot3\\cdot4=24$. Surface area $=2(4\\cdot5+4\\cdot6+5\\cdot6)=2(20+24+30)=148$ (in units of a cube face).\n\n**Answer: (A) 148**"
